{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c6623060a6fb5c09b0c2dce8b8865b8208084bf98cb77858cac5edc81cae062c", "ja": "（真が不思議な妖精に出会う『少女』役を演じることに\nなった。真は最高に張り切っていたが……）", "zh": "（真将要出演与不可思议的妖精相遇的“少女”一角。真干劲十足，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "6a1bc2c33a777a8f20c7f677c0f02bcf195cbd20b1ac30ac1af74ab634052ac4", "ja": "ううっ……今日に限って靴擦れなんて……。\n撮影も順調だったのになあ。", "zh": "呜呜……偏偏在今天磨破脚……\n拍摄明明还挺顺利的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1002_p", "source_sha256": "88abb279bed01ac8bafa59ae6cc498b6b7d4cea384da4f20b2e1f5db3d857ac6", "ja": "テーピングで補強してみたけど、どうだ？\n踊るシーンもあるから、きつめにしたけど……。", "zh": "我试着用胶带加固了一下，怎么样？\n因为还有跳舞的场景，所以缠得紧了些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "dde9112ebd15d2d0da3bf71760483514ee3f27c49aec569747e490a615a2ef5f", "ja": "えっと……うん。痛みは平気です！\nありがとうございます、{$P$}！", "zh": "那个……嗯，已经不痛了！\n谢谢你，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "9d502d3ef151dad50376459a79c7d4f4d5f810e9acae37bce55811b9f970c72b", "ja": "……はあ～。", "zh": "……哈～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f093e038af38e70fe4416fcded8ca904010611815fb682af5d1b550fd4c29bbb", "ja": "どうした？　あまり大丈夫じゃなさそうだな。\nやっぱりテーピング緩めるか？", "zh": "怎么了？看起来好像不太妙啊。\n还是把绷带放松一点吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "20b59f69eca582bf52a95d7b70c3dbf6426aa8b26352933896c250461ef22915", "ja": "い、いえ！　本当に足は痛くないんです！\n痛くないんですけど……なんていうか……。", "zh": "没、没有！脚真的不疼！\n虽然不疼……但该怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "c117a41c5b7f3462ccf6ab2f070be097abb66a9ce3fff631c0c86c06627cff84", "ja": "今回の役って、とってもカワイイじゃないですか！\nだから、ボク……全力で頑張るって決めてたんです！", "zh": "这次的角色不是特别可爱嘛！\n所以，我……已经决定要全力以赴了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "e494475efaa3cfe3236230ca1628454c884d16115adae6605cd45cfaec020cc7", "ja": "それなのに、ケガして、撮影を中断させるとか。\n何やってんだって感じです……。", "zh": "明明这样，却还受了伤，害得拍摄中断。真是的，我到底在干什么啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "05d0a15af367ee185681d7fa9c2cd97a305064767e379689f9a2451835234e1e", "ja": "（うーん……張り切っていただけに、\n力が入りすぎて、空回ってるのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（嗯……正因为太过投入，反而用力过猛，可能有点使不上劲了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7b0b4314d638d37c95e8a18aaf9179bf6e7ffd83ef52d9f65c0adc70a8cee1aa", "ja": "そんなことないぞ。\nだって、真は優しくてカワイイ人間の少女だろう？", "zh": "哪有这回事。因为，真可是温柔又可爱的人类少女啊，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "4b5aba3c5c15199eba2a44bff797b5f5c2bf86b2eb194994859b33e934e5b195", "ja": "……へっ？　{$P$}？\nいきなり、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "……咦？{$P$}？\n怎么突然说这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ace81034d3ead2949be6f4b61458be0acbd3d72d4e5aa559a6e69f4a8c7f0144", "ja": "どうしたも何も……その衣装は、真のために\n妖精たちが用意したプレゼントって設定だったよな。", "zh": "这还用问吗……这套服装，设定上不是说是妖精们为真准备的礼物吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a39f9c84b3a032ffae175e9832308bc1aaee9aaa9d217845ee4779ad638c7e3d", "ja": "きっと人間界に無い特殊な素材を使ってるはずだ。\nだから靴も、履き慣れるのに時間がかかって当然だよ。", "zh": "一定使用了人类世界没有的特殊材料。\n所以鞋子要花些时间才能穿习惯，也是理所当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "bec67be3b30fb6b64b2478f335b221f1b5be5f853891d76b92ff4ea0666bb58c", "ja": "{$P$}……。ぷっ、ふふっ。\nもう。言ってることが、フェアリーすぎますよ♪", "zh": "{$P$}……噗，呵呵。真是的，你说的话也太像精灵了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "9175224b1f410417e0fae4d6b1cbb7b00fde817cabfdd4d64eb23bc6ab6bd87b", "ja": "でも……、ありがとうございます。\nおかげで、なんか元気出てきました。えへへっ♪", "zh": "不过……还是谢谢你。\n多亏了你，我感觉好像打起精神来了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1016_p", "source_sha256": "72ab1f00dd0ecfa7adc0284aebc2b3ccd3d2643033935c2be99f53b0c91f64e1", "ja": "……よかった。そうやって笑っていると、もう\nかわいい少女そのものだ。やっぱり真はかわいいな。", "zh": "……太好了。你像这样笑起来，\n就已经完全是个可爱的美少女了。真果然很可爱啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "f3634b5c6f3380df44516819a6b467847033f04f34dc64b1a173d7f52f6b7812", "ja": "だ、だから、もう大丈夫ですってば～！\nそれ以上ホメられると、ボク……。", "zh": "所、所以说，已经没事了啦～！\n再继续被夸下去的话，我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7318a6ebfa6ec32f99ab6803fb5d248ae3fd87e7414a93828daa4c09c6ea7c66", "ja": "あ……しまった。\n撮影再開するには、ちょっと……顔が……。", "zh": "啊……糟了。\n要重新开始拍摄的话，这张脸……有点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0144_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "c119459f60d5e85db5b7bbc59bf4991e90dd73621361c9a319ff3a20b57193c5", "ja": "え？　……ああっ、火照りすぎてる！\nちょ、ちょっとメイクさんとこ行ってきます～～～！", "zh": "诶？……啊，脸也太红了！\n我、我先去找化妆师～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
